M09_Objective_Controller::objective[3] records which primary objectives were
accomplished (set in Custom) and is reported back through the "check" event when
Mobius is killed, to decide which objective pog to fail. It was not saved, so
after a load the failed objective came from indeterminate memory. Register it
with the unused id 6 (ids 1-5 are spawn_loc/block1-4). Saves without id 6 still
load (unknown/missing ids are ignored by the original loader).

--- a/Mission09.cpp
+++ b/Mission09.cpp
@@ -60,6 +60,8 @@
 		SAVE_VARIABLE( block2, 3 );
 		SAVE_VARIABLE( block3, 4 );
 		SAVE_VARIABLE( block4, 5 );
+		// Vita save/load: set in Custom(); read back by the Mobius Killed() "check" event.
+		SAVE_VARIABLE( objective, 6 );
 	}

 	void Created(GameObject * obj)
